color:black'>.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">  </span><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">       </span><span class="SpellE">Am</span>(</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;
font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>V</span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>)<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span class="SpellE"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";
color:black'>Древнеяпонская</span></span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>
страна<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">       </span>G(</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>III</span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:
"Courier New";color:black'>)<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span class="GramE"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>Полна</span></span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>
извилистых
идей,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">          
</span>F<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>А
вот в Габоне -
тишина,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">         
</span>E<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>Никто
не видел там
людей.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">        
</span><span class="SpellE">Am</span>(</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:
10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black;mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>V</span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>)<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span class="SpellE"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";
color:black'>Тефаль</span></span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'> не
думает о них,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">      </span>G(</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>III</span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:
"Courier New";color:black'>)<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>Ему
сломали
мозжечок<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">        </span><span style="mso-spacerun:yes"> </span>F<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>Он
не успел
пропеть свой
стих,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">           
</span>E<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>Попавшись
смерти на
крючок<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">  </span><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">      </span>Dm<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>Париж
закутан в
дортуар.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">        
</span>Em<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>Графиня
мчится на
разбой.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">         
</span>F<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>Виконт
ломает
самовар<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">         
</span>E<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>Тяжелой
джазовой
трубой.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>Проигрыш</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>: <span class="GramE">Am(</span>V) G(III) F E - 2p.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black;
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>Поверив
жадному орлу,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>Деревья
гнутся
поперек.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>Скучает
барышня в
углу<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>Ей
тайны вальса
невдомек.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>И
если море
хочет жить,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>Ему
придется
подождать,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>Пока
судьбы тупая
нить<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>Не
перестанет
блефовать.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>Париж
закутан в
дортуар.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>Графиня
мчится на
разбой.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
